title: Payers › Every pop-up › Save, discard, close
route: /payers/:id
intro: One page for how every Payers pop-up closes. Nothing is saved by closing: Cancel, the X, Escape and a click on the dimmed area all throw away what was typed, with no 'are you sure'. There is no undo; a saved edit is reversed by editing again, and the edit log keeps the old text.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Any Payers pop-up is open"
overlay ov "Ten pop-ups\nAdd a payer, Edit payer details, Edit log, Edit workflow,\nSave the workflow?, Edit the instructions for Caller,\nEdit a rule, Edit what a payer wants, Acknowledge this change?,\nUpdate drafts?, plus the menus inside them"

group gX "Ways to close"
  click x1 "Click 'Cancel'"
  click x2 "Click the X ('Close')"
  click x3 "Press Escape"
  click x4 "Click the dimmed area outside"
endgroup

process cl "The pop-up is asked to close"
decision dk "Which pop-up is it?"
process pl "Plain pop-up (everything except the cases below)\nCloses. Typed text and picks are discarded\nNothing is saved or logged"
process rd "Edit log\nRead only, nothing to save or discard"
process sv "'Save the workflow?' over the Edit workflow drawer"
decision ek "Which way was it closed?"
process one "Cancel, X or dimmed area\nOnly the reason modal closes\nThe drawer keeps every edit"
process both "Escape closes the reason modal AND the drawer\nEvery unsaved workflow edit is lost"
process bz "'Update drafts?' while the agents work (about 3 seconds)\nCancel is greyed, Escape, X and dimmed area do nothing\nWait for it to finish"
process mn "A menu open inside a pop-up\n(Plan type, Group, Reached by, Level of care, Case, step type)\nEscape closes the menu and also the pop-up"

group gS "Ways to save (the primary button)"
  process sa "'Save and log the edit' needs a reason\nEmpty reason: 'Add a reason. It goes in the edit log.'"
  process sb "'Add payer' needs a name, a way to reach and a program"
  process sc "'Acknowledge change' and 'Update N drafts' are confirm buttons\nthey need no typing"
  process sd "If nothing differs from what is saved:\n'Nothing changed' (or 'Nothing to save' in the workflow drawer)"
endgroup

store sv1 "Saved: the change is in force for new drafts\nOne edit log entry per change"
process undo "No undo, revert or 'restore previous' button\nTo go back: edit again. Edit log shows the before text"
end e1 "Back on the page, nothing half saved"
endx x0 "Closed without saving"

s1 --> ov
ov --> x1 & x2 & x3 & x4
x1 --> cl
x2 --> cl
x3 --> cl
x4 --> cl
cl --> dk
dk -->|Plain| pl --> x0
dk -->|Edit log| rd --> x0
dk -->|Save the workflow?| sv --> ek
ek -->|Cancel, X, dimmed area| one --> x0
ek -->|Escape| both --> x0
dk -->|Update drafts?, busy| bz --> e1
dk -->|Menu open| mn --> x0
ov --> sa --> sv1
ov --> sb --> sv1
ov --> sc --> sv1
sa --> sd
sv1 --> e1
e1 -.-> undo
